{
  "info": {
    "name": "MediGest API v1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Colección de la API de MediGest.\n\n1. Importe también el entorno `MediGest.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Escriba en el entorno `password` (la clave de las cuentas demo, valor de DEMO_PASSWORD en su .env). No la suba a ningún repositorio.\n3. Ejecute `1. Autenticación > Login`: el token se guarda solo y el resto de peticiones lo usan.\n4. Cambie `email` para probar otros roles: admin@medigest.test, recepcion1@medigest.test, medico1@medigest.test, paciente1@medigest.test."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "citaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "esperaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "notificacionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Guarda accessToken y refreshToken en las variables de la colección."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login correcto', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const d = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refrescar token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const d = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
